  "prompt": "For each day from 8 to 15 December 2025, by event_date, split the sessions that started into visitors' first sessions and returning ones. The ga_session_number parameter, in int_value, counts the visitor's sessions: 1 is the first, and more than 1 a return. A session is one user_pseudo_id with one ga_session_id, counted from its session_start event; leave out session_start events whose user_pseudo_id or ga_session_id is missing. Return event_date, as the text the export stores, first_sessions and returning_sessions. Return one row for each day with a session start; a day with none has no row. Any row order is fine.",
